  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin L1.K\n* issue: duplicate_name L1\n* issue: floating_pin C1.D\n* issue: floating_pin C1.S\n* issue: dangling_wire w8\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\nDL1 0 n1 DSCH\nDL12 0 0 DSCH\nMC1 n2 0 n3 n3 NMOSE\n.model DSCH D(IS=1e-8 N=1.05)\n.model NMOSE NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1 KP=1e-3)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
